OL,3,GNEWSAFree parking row puts district
OL,4,Ascheme on hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for free weekday parking across a
OL,7,Fdistrict have been paused amid a row
OL,8,Fbetween a mayor and a council.
OL,10,FPaul Bristow, the Conservative mayor of
OL,11,Fthe Cambridgeshire and Peterborough
OL,12,FCombined Authority (CPCA), previously
OL,13,Fpledged #1.5m to trial free parking at
OL,14,Fcertain times in parts of Peterborough
OL,15,Fand Huntingdonshire.
OL,17,FThe scheme is operating in
OL,18,FPeterborough, but plans to do the same
OL,19,Fafter 16:00 in Huntingdonshire are on
OL,20,Fhold because Bristow said he had "lost
OL,21,Ffaith in [the council's] ability to
OL,22,Fdeliver" the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
